.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH snip-list 1  "snip 0.5.2" 
.SH NAME
snip\-list \- List snippets without their full content
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsnip list\fR [\fB\-\-folder\fR] [\fB\-\-library\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-subfolders\fR] [\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-tag\fR] [\fB\-\-sort\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List snippets without their full content
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-folder\fR \fI<FOLDER>\fR
Restrict to a folder and its subfolders. Pass "" for Uncategorized
.TP
\fB\-\-library\fR \fI<LIBRARY>\fR
Library root. Falls back to SNIP_LIBRARY, ancestor discovery, then config
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-subfolders\fR
Restrict \-\-folder to that folder alone, excluding its subfolders
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR
Structured output mode for commands that return records
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
human
.IP \(bu 2
json
.IP \(bu 2
jsonl
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<COLOR>\fR
Color policy for terminal preview
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-tag\fR \fI<TAG>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-sort\fR \fI<SORT>\fR [default: modified]
Order of the listing. Pinned snippets always come first
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
modified: Most recently modified first. Legacy `manual` config values migrate here
.IP \(bu 2
title: Case\-insensitive title, ascending
.IP \(bu 2
created: Most recently created first
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
